        "body": "The first row in the image has 147 anomalous pixels less than full-white. The boat is surrounded by those strange 434 spots of alpha. The metadata has the public key FF2142E98E09b5344994F9bEB9C56C95506B9F17 and the modification date is 203 seconds behind the creation date. There are 5 buildings left, 7 buildings right, 1 big boat and 5 small boats. Also I suppose you could imagine the pier to have an IX or XI, or just X roman numeral. The name of the file may not be relevant, but it can be decoded to 32 bytes from Base85 ascii, but nothing falls out."
